From: VAMS contributors <vams@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] hw/misc: add reset notification and CQ throttling

Notify an active PCIe request before management or watchdog reset clears the
firmware portal. Add programmable completion-queue watermark hysteresis and
persistent high-water/backpressure evidence so overload stops SQ consumption
before the CQ becomes full.

Signed-off-by: VAMS contributors <vams@example.com>
